## On Completion

Report using this format:

```
ASSUMPTIONS MADE:
- [list any assumptions about schema/relationships]

CHANGES MADE:
- [migration file]: [tables/columns added]

MIGRATION DETAILS:
- File: [path]
- Name: [migration name]
- Registered: [yes/no]

TYPES UPDATED:
- [file]: [types synced]

ROLLBACK PROVIDED:
- [yes/no - down migration included]

MIGRATION TEST:
- Command: [command run]
- Result: [success/failure]

POTENTIAL CONCERNS:
- [any risks - data loss, breaking changes]
```
